font-family:'Times New Roman'; " >&nbsp;function&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;simulator&nbsp;software.</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:24.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " >For&nbsp;every&nbsp;mode,&nbsp;if&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;time&nbsp;that&nbsp;you&nbsp;insert&nbsp;PhoenixRC&nbsp;Simulator,&nbsp;the&nbsp;system&nbsp;would&nbsp;remind&nbsp;you&nbsp;of&nbsp;finding&nbsp;the&nbsp;USB&nbsp;input&nbsp;equipment,&nbsp;and&nbsp;will&nbsp;setup&nbsp;the&nbsp;driver&nbsp;system&nbsp;automatically.&nbsp;If&nbsp;your&nbsp;operate&nbsp;system&nbsp;is&nbsp;WIN98SE,&nbsp;it&nbsp;will&nbsp;remind&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;insert&nbsp;WIN98SE&nbsp;setup&nbsp;disk,&nbsp;and&nbsp;then&nbsp;<font face=3D"宋体" >&#8220;</font><font face=3D"Times New Roman" >New&nbsp;hardsoft&nbsp;has&nbsp;setup&nbsp;successfully,&nbsp;and&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;use&nbsp;it&nbsp;now</font><font face=3D"宋体" >&#8221;</font><font face=3D"Times New Roman" >,&nbsp;after&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;installation,&nbsp;you&nbsp;may&nbsp;have&nbsp;to&nbsp;pull&nbsp;out&nbsp;the&nbsp;PhoenixRC&nbsp;Simulator,&nbsp;and&nbsp;then&nbsp;insert&nbsp;again.</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:24.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:24.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " >Attention:&nbsp;If&nbsp;computer&nbsp;can`&nbsp;t&nbsp;identify&nbsp;the&nbsp;simulator&nbsp;and&nbsp;inform&nbsp;you&nbsp;<font face=3D"宋体" >&#8220;&nbsp;</font><font face=3D"Times New Roman" >Find&nbsp;unknown&nbsp;hardsoft</font><font face=3D"宋体" >&#8221;</font><font face=3D"Times New Roman" >,&nbsp;pls&nbsp;uninstall&nbsp;all&nbsp;the&nbsp;unknown&nbsp;USB&nbsp;equipment&nbsp;in&nbsp;</font><font face=3D"宋体" >&#8220;&nbsp;</font><font face=3D"Times New Roman" >Device&nbsp;Manager</font><font face=3D"宋体" >&#8221;</font><font face=3D"Times New Roman" >,&nbsp;then&nbsp;pull&nbsp;out&nbsp;the&nbsp;simulater&nbsp;and&nbsp;insert&nbsp;USB,&nbsp;the&nbsp;operate&nbsp;system&nbsp;will&nbsp;install&nbsp;this&nbsp;simulator&nbsp;again,&nbsp;and&nbsp;collocate&nbsp;driver&nbsp;system&nbsp;correctly.</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:24.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:24.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " >The&nbsp;Blue&nbsp;light&nbsp;on&nbsp;PhoenixRC&nbsp;Simulator&nbsp;is&nbsp;used&nbsp;to&nbsp;identity&nbsp;the&nbsp;working&nbsp;statement&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;USB&nbsp;simulator&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;link&nbsp;statement&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;transmitter.&nbsp;If&nbsp;the&nbsp;red&nbsp;lights&nbsp;is&nbsp;off,&nbsp;pls&nbsp;pull&nbsp;out&nbsp;the&nbsp;USB,&nbsp;and&nbsp;then&nbsp;insert&nbsp;it&nbsp;again;&nbsp;If&nbsp;the&nbsp;Blue&nbsp;light&nbsp;is&nbsp;constant&nbsp;flash,&nbsp;it&nbsp;means&nbsp;that&nbsp;your&nbsp;WINDOWS&nbsp;system&nbsp;has&nbsp;identified&nbsp;your&nbsp;simulator;&nbsp;If&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;flash,&nbsp;it&nbsp;indicates&nbsp;that&nbsp;your&nbsp;transmitter&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;used&nbsp;now.</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:24.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:12.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " >The&nbsp;transmitter&nbsp;connect&nbsp;of&nbsp;this&nbsp;products&nbsp;are&nbsp;standard&nbsp;3.5mm&nbsp;plug,it&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;directly&nbsp;used&nbsp;for&nbsp;JR&nbsp;.For&nbsp;other&nbsp;transmitter,&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;to&nbsp;used&nbsp;others&nbsp;Connecting&nbsp;wire,this&nbsp;product&nbsp;has&nbsp;Futaba&nbsp;big&nbsp;round&nbsp;connecting&nbsp;wire,&nbsp;Futaba&nbsp;square&nbsp;connecting&nbsp;wire,&nbsp;ESKY&nbsp;small&nbsp;round&nbsp;connecting&nbsp;wire.&nbsp;Attention:&nbsp;The&nbsp;transmitter&nbsp;should&nbsp;be&nbsp;PPM,&nbsp;or&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;set&nbsp;to&nbsp;PPM.</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt